Title: Three Ages
Credit: Sample script — one character at 10, 28 and 50

EXT. VILLAGE - DAY #1#

ARJUN (10) flies a kite. RAVI (30) watches.

ARJUN
Higher!

EXT. VILLAGE - NIGHT #2#

Arjun sleeps under the stars. Ravi keeps watch.

EXT. CITY - DAY #3#

SUPER: EIGHTEEN YEARS LATER

ARJUN (28) runs for a bus. RAVI (40s) sells tea at the stop.

ARJUN
One chai, quick.

INT. OFFICE - DAY #4#

Arjun at his desk.

EXT. CITY - DAY #5#

SUPER: TWENTY-TWO YEARS LATER

ARJUN (50), grey at the temples, buys the tea stall.

ARJUN
It's mine now.

INT. TEA STALL - NIGHT #6#

Arjun counts the day's coins.
